Package: saeHB.ZIB
Type: Package
Title: Small Area Estimation using Hierarchical Bayesian under Zero
        Inflated Binomial Distribution
Version: 0.1.1
Author: Rizqina Rahmati, Azka Ubaidillah
Maintainer: Rizqina Rahmati <221810583@stis.ac.id>
Description: Provides function for area level of small area estimation
        using hierarchical Bayesian (HB) method with Zero-Inflated
        Binomial distribution for variables of interest. Some dataset
        produced by a data generation are also provided. The 'rjags'
        package is employed to obtain parameter estimates. Model-based
        estimators involves the HB estimators which include the mean
        and the variation of mean.
